    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d680">

                <pb facs="0696" n="592" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg592"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 815.001 B 64/16.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The President of Honduras to
                        the President.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-03-24">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 24, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Government and people of Honduras join me in thanking Your Excellency and the
                    Government and people of the United States for their very sincere expressions of
                    sorrow for the death of President General Bonilla. Will Your Excellency accept
                    our gratitude.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francisco Bertrand</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
